          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye gin mumiyo wapwoyo Lubaŋa kare ki kare, pien cakke ma wugamo lok pa Lubaŋa ma wuwinyo ki botwa, pe wugamo macalo lok pa dano, ento macalo lok pa Lubaŋa. Ada aye lok pa Lubaŋa tye bene ka tic i iwu wun jo muye Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 17.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Utmegiwa, wun bene wumako kit pa lwak jo muye Lubaŋa ma tye i Kricito Yecu, i kabedo ducu ma tye i Judaya, pien wun bene wuneno can ki bot lutuwu kikome ma rom ki can ma gin guneno bot Lujudaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
